OL,5,G1300 Blue Bloods
OL,6,     FAn officer involved in the
OL,7,     Fcontroversial shooting of an
OL,8,     Funarmed person 14 years prior is
OL,9,     Fup for a promotion, forcing Frank
OL,10,     FReagan to make a difficult
OL,11,     Fdecision.
OL,12,G1400 NCIS: Los Angeles
OL,13,     FAfter NCIS fails to locate a mole
OL,14,     Fin the department, Under Secretary
OL,15,     Fof Defense Corbin Duggan insists
OL,16,     Fon new leadership and takes over
OL,17,     Fthe Los Angeles unit from Hetty
OL,18,     Fand Granger.
