OL,5,G1500 NCIS: Los Angeles
OL,6,     FThe team travels to Syria to
OL,7,     Fcapture a high-value target but
OL,8,     Fthe mission goes awry when their
OL,9,     Fchopper is shot down. The OSP team
OL,10,     Fmust work around Duggan to ensure
OL,11,     Fthey get out alive.
OL,12,G1600 NCIS: Los Angeles
OL,13,     FThe team investigates an abduction
OL,14,     Fcase while down two members, with
OL,15,     FHetty being held in D.C. for
