OL,6,     FAfter a Homeland Security agent is
OL,7,     Fpoisoned by a notorious Triad
OL,8,     Fassassin, NCIS uncovers a
OL,9,     Fwarehouse of counterfeit purses
OL,10,     Fand a money trail to stolen
OL,11,     Fgovernment funds.
OL,12,G1800 NCIS: Los Angeles
OL,13,     FThe murder of a navy machinist
OL,14,     Fwith high security clearance sends
OL,15,     Fthe team on a city-wide hunt
OL,16,     Ftracking evidence.
OL,17,G1900 NCIS: Los Angeles
OL,18,     FAfter a maintenance man saved the
OL,19,     Flife of a lieutenant commander,
OL,20,     Fthe NCIS team uncovers his dark
OL,21,     Fpast that puts a local teenager in
OL,22,     Fdanger.
