OL,9,     Fdistribution concerning hundreds
OL,10,     Fof underage students.
OL,11,G2300 Law & Order: Special Victims Unit
OL,12,     FVelasco teams up with a community
OL,13,     Fsecurity guard eager to prove his
OL,14,     Fmettle to find a suspect in the
OL,15,     Fassault of two teens.
OL,16,G0000 Criminal Minds
OL,17,     FThe BAU team head to Portland to
OL,18,     Finvestigate a chilling abduction
OL,19,     Fthat may be linked to a local
OL,20,     Fcouple killed in their home a week
OL,21,     Fearlier.
